{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete (-> replaced by)\nGO:0047499    calcium-independent phospholipase A2 activity\t-> GO:0004623 phospholipase A2 activity\nGO:0047498    calcium-dependent phospholipase A2 activity -> GO:0004623 phospholipase A2 activity\nGO:0050429    calcium-dependent phospholipase C activity -> GO:0140324 C-type lysophospholipase activity (new)\n\nAnnotations are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OHJKmvud1xeTHe7y-M9pUjKzh7e0_YzBaoQS2obg7JY/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\n<google-sheets-html-origin><style type=\"text/css\"><!--td {border: 1px solid #cccccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}--></style>\nBHF-UCL | 2 - done\n-- | --\nCACAO | 1\nCAFA | 1\ndictyBase | 1\nFlyBase | 2\nGeneDB | 1\nMGI | 3\nPINC | 2\nReactome | 5\nRGD | 7\nSGD | 2\nUniProt | 67\nWB | 1\n\n\n+ 2 InterPro mappings: \n\n- InterPro:IPR047148 85/88 kDa calcium-independent phospholipase A2 > GO:calcium-independent phospholipase A2 activity ; GO:0047499\n- InterPro:IPR028392 1-phosphatidylinositol 4,5-bisphosphate phosphodiesterase eta-1, catalytic domain > GO:calcium-dependent phospholipase C activity ; GO:0050429\n- \n", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:49:27Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to calcium-dependent/independent phospholipase", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-11-18T19:47:23Z"}
